\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Brightly gleams our banner,
\par Pointing to the sky,
\par Waving on Christ's soldiers
\par To their home on high.
\par Marching through the desert,
\par Gladly thus we pray,
\par Still with hearts united
\par Singing on our way.
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par \'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Brightly gleams our banner,
\par Pointing to the sky,
\par Waving on Christ's soldiers
\par To their home on high.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Jesus, Lord and Master,
\par At Thy sacred feet,
\par Here, with hearts rejoicing,
\par See Thy children meet.
\par Often have we left Thee,
\par Often gone astray;
\par Keep us, mighty Saviour,
\par In the narrow way.
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par \'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Brightly gleams our banner,
\par Pointing to the sky,
\par Waving on Christ's soldiers
\par To their home on high.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. All our days direct us
\par In the way we go;
\par Lead us on victorious
\par Over every foe;
\par Bid Thine angels shield us
\par When the storm-clouds lower;
\par Pardon Thou and save us
\par In the last dread hour.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Brightly gleams our banner,
\par Pointing to the sky,
\par Waving on Christ's soldiers
\par To their home on high.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Then with saints and angels
\par May we join above,
\par Offering prayers and praises
\par At Thy throne of love.
\par When the march is over,
\par Then come the rest and peace,
\par Jesus in His beauty,
\par Songs that never cease.
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par \'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Brightly gleams our banner,
\par Pointing to the sky,
\par Waving on Christ's soldiers
\par To their home on high.
\par 
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

